  "id": "pork-chops-with-tomatoes-and-feta",
  "name": "Pork Chops with Tomatoes and Feta",
  "subtitle": "Skillet pork with sweet tomatoes and tangy feta",
  "description": "Browned onions and tender pork chops are paired with a warm grape-tomato topping, balsamic vinegar, feta, and lemon.",
